      "content": "Can you elaborate more on the unpredictability that sometimes occurs during these high-heat transitions? Even when the pH and sugar concentrations are calculated, there are moments in the pan where the browning seems to skip or behave erratically, almost like the reaction is being disrupted by something unseen at a microscopic level. Is there a known kinetic reason for those sudden, irregular shifts in color development?",
